Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:17.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.22,0:01:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.16,0:01:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.98,0:01:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们真是疾控中心的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You expect me to believe you're cdc?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.42,0:01:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么  只是你们早来了一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that you're a day early.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.86,0:01:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,史上第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time in history i haven't sat on my ass
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.52,0:01:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不用干等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.00,0:01:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新管理班子\N{\fnArial\fs30}New administration.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.29,0:01:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,值得你的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}A change you can believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.59,0:01:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.39,0:01:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米特·塞维尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet xavier.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.87,0:01:52.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生于1984年4月3日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Date of birth -- april 3, 1984.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.11,0:01:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.18,0:01:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做了两次DNA测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran the dna twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.98,0:01:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定就是他本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's definitely him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.04,0:01:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来他不怎么涂防晒霜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he wasn't big on the sunscreen, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.18,0:02:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有何想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's your theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.62,0:02:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只可确定  死者为男性  25岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is, decedent's male, 25 years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.88,0:02:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因衰老而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he died of old age.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得没错  肯定有灵异\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right about this one. it's definitely a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.03,0:02:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.57,0:02:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,镇上还有其他受害者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any other stiffs in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一名死者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the one body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.74,0:02:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.01,0:02:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些人失踪  但这种大小的镇 也很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple missing persons, but usual for a town this size.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.58,0:02:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  去查清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, check 'em out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.74,0:02:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为这其中有关联吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think they're connected?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.48,0:02:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-预感有  - 明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call it a hunch. - You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.37,0:02:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,顺便  你最近如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, by the way, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.13,0:02:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.69,0:02:35.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.55,0:02:37.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也知道  总体而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, just...in general?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说我的腿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you mean my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.72,0:02:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我抱着哈根达斯泪流满面呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, i'm just weepin' in my haagen-dazs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.86,0:02:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idjit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.27,0:02:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是最近照的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the most recent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.41,0:03:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他失踪多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long has he been missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.01,0:03:03.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他星期二晚上没有回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I knew right away
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he didn't come home tuesday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.95,0:03:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他下班后常去什么地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there someplace he likes to go after work, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.23,0:03:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如酒吧之类\N{\fnArial\fs30}A favorite bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.19,0:03:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.29,0:03:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一般在星期二  他总是工作得晚些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuesdays, he always works a bit late,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他总是直接回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he always comes straight home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.49,0:03:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能四处看看吗  女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}May i use your facilities, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.82,0:03:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"工作到很晚"吗  鬼才信\N{\fnArial\fs30}"working late," my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.67,0:03:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少他很专一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least he's consistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.19,0:03:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每周二都定同一间钟点房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same room every tuesday, hourly rates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.73,0:03:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望我到了那把年纪还能欲望充沛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope I got that kind of kick when I'm his age.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.27,0:03:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们活得了那么久吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, like either of us will live that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.36,0:03:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也对\N{\fnArial\fs30}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  猜那里面有什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So... what do you think's in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.79,0:03:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皱巴巴黏糊糊的尸体吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wrinkly, gooey corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god! oh, god!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.61,0:04:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! oh, god!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.12,0:04:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞毛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.18,0:04:16.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. god.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.69,0:04:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,果然又软又黏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gooey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.22,0:04:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进错房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got the wrong room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.23,0:04:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.63,0:04:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纹身不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有认识叫克里夫·维洛的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happen to know anybody named Cliff Whitlow?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.37,0:04:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从没听过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.47,0:04:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.34,0:04:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你带着他的钱包呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you're carrying his wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.68,0:04:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你妻子告诉我们你这里有胎记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife told us about your, uh, birthmark there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.28,0:04:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:51.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来很好嘛  克里夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you look great, cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.35,0:04:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是整容了还是怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get some work done?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.63,0:04:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能让我们单独谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you give us some privacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.30,0:05:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.97,0:05:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.83,0:05:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,千万不能告诉我老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't tell my wife
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.74,0:05:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你们  要是被她知道  我就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you. as far as she knows, i'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看在上帝的份上  替我保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the love of god, let's keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.31,0:05:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎可能是克里夫·维洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you possibly be cliff whitlow?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.24,0:05:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不然我们告诉你老婆去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, either you tell us or we tell the missus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay! okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.46,0:05:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是一场游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.12,0:05:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电子游戏那种的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like...xbox?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.72,0:05:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啥电子游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's xbox?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.32,0:05:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  是扑克游戏  高风险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. poker -- high-stakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.66,0:05:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不赌现金  而是生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead of cash, you play for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.46,0:05:30.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.53,0:05:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这听起来很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know it sounds crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.23,0:05:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在酒吧里遇到一个男人  他邀我玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy comes up to me at a bar, invites me to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他给了我25个怪异的筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gives me 25 of these weirdo poker chips, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.28,0:05:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对着他们念了堆听不懂的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chants some mumbo humbo over them,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,声称它们现在代表25年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says now they're 25 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.70,0:05:43.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还嘲笑他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm laughing...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.44,0:05:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我出来后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I come out up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.59,0:05:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就变成这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.68,0:05:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-什么咒语  - 我咋知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was he chanting? - How should i know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.38,0:05:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道  我屁股也不疼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is, my bad hip's good,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,眼镜也摔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I threw away my glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.18,0:05:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿还有成堆的妞儿等着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of those ladies was here for free!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.08,0:05:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这男人真是奇迹创造者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man's some kind of miracle worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.85,0:05:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个奇迹创造者长啥样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does this miracle worker look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.72,0:05:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.77,0:06:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,35岁左右  棕色头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe 35, brown hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.09,0:06:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱尔兰口音  他叫帕特里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irish accent. his name was patrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.02,0:06:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这游戏是在哪玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right. where's this game at?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.43,0:06:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说他喜欢旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he likes to keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.75,0:06:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从不固定待在一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}never stays in one bar
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:08.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只能由他来选择你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he finds you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.48,0:06:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了  克里夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.87,0:06:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.45,0:06:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这风格不错  保持保持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay classy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.45,0:06:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这听起来太疯狂了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds crazy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.85,0:06:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  事实上的确有这样的传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. there's lore on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.55,0:06:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几世纪前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goes back centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.45,0:06:30.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小镇上会出现卡牌旅人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traveling card player pops into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.52,0:06:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你打败他  就能赢会黄金时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}You beat him, you get your best years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.86,0:06:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  大多数人都输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'course, most folks lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.79,0:06:36.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就能解释皱巴巴的尸体了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that would explain the crunchy corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.73,0:06:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据说  那家伙玩的一手玩牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supposedly, this player's a hell of a card shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.90,0:06:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赢了很多年华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a lot of years in the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你找到他出没的酒吧了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find the bar he's working in yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这镇上酒吧太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot of dives in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.33,0:06:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们准备分头找\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.84,0:06:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你还讲什么电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why you still talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.53,0:07:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,屁都没有  你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a whole bunch of squat. you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.69,0:07:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-还没有  - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, not a thing.  - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.62,0:07:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是没找什么的话  2点回旅馆去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you come up dry, circle back to the motel in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,轮到你买晚饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn to grab dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.16,0:07:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-和平时吃的一样吗  - 加培根\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Usually.  - Extra bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.78,0:07:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来杯啤酒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get a beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.20,0:07:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't happen to know of a poker game
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.17,0:07:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里面有人在玩扑克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going on in back, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.70,0:07:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是酒吧  不是赌场\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bar, not a casino.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.51,0:07:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有个叫本的朋友说你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend ben told me you'd know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不认识什么叫本的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know any ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.95,0:07:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自作聪明的秃头  一个花花肠子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, balding, smart-ass, real ladies' man?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  朋友  告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, pal, I told you --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.29,0:07:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我根本不认识本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know any ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.65,0:07:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不知道什么扑克游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know nothing about a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗  因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure? 'cause, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好像真的认识你哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sure seems to know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.87,0:07:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绕到后面  乘电梯下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}'round back. take the elevator down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.24,0:07:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.51,0:08:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这儿干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.74,0:08:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来种花的  你以为啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Planting daisies. what's it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.98,0:08:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来查案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came in on the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.58,0:08:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你先下手为强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you beat me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.25,0:08:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很明显  大脑战胜大腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, brains trumps legs, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你找到玩扑克的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you found the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.46,0:08:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你阻止他们了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.16,0:08:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能算阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.26,0:08:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我玩了游戏  行了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I played, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.07,0:08:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.12,0:08:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和男巫玩牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You played some -- some he-witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.22,0:08:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别用这种口气教训我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you take that tone with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.50,0:08:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.09,0:08:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我自己的年华  随我怎么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're my years! I can do what i want!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.96,0:08:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你输了多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many did you lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.63,0:08:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,25年\N{\fnArial\fs30}25.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这事儿还没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.97,0:09:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说你会读心术吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're saying that you're a mind reader.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.01,0:09:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得啦  没有的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, come on. no such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.05,0:09:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我能分析人的心理\N{\fnArial\fs30}But i can read people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.48,0:09:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好比你这位美丽的女伴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your lovely companion here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.86,0:09:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从她精致的姿势判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say, judging from her exquisite posture,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.42,0:09:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她以前是位舞者\N{\fnArial\fs30}She used to be a dancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.69,0:09:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不怎么喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much of a drinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.36,0:09:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很有主见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very independent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.60,0:09:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.43,0:09:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.47,0:09:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能和你谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I borrow you for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.41,0:09:39.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  当然啦  太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. of course. great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.44,0:09:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.21,0:09:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,失陪一下  两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you two please excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.72,0:09:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to cut you short
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.39,0:09:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打断你和目标夫妇之间的谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}With mr. and mrs. easy marks over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.12,0:09:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no big.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.19,0:09:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不完全失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't a total loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.29,0:09:57.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你或许觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't know what it is you think i did
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.53,0:09:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我对你的妻子或女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}To your wife or girlfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.03,0:10:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,母亲或姐姐做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother or sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是要知道  我的感受是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, i just want you to know, my feelings were real.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不关我的事  你这男巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't my problem, man-witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.24,0:10:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你欠我朋友一些年华\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe my friend some years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.97,0:10:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  原来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.27,0:10:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  但他输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. he lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.41,0:10:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生命一下子就停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Them's the breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.71,0:10:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就放了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then un-lose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.05,0:10:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  开枪好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, go ahead and shoot me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.98,0:10:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这能使你好受点\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it makes you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.39,0:10:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,此外  我是想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, i could use a good...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.09,0:10:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挠挠痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...tickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.43,0:10:33.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要回年华吗  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want years? great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.06,0:10:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就和我玩牌吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play me for 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.67,0:10:36.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.87,0:10:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我自己的年华  随我怎么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're my years. I can do what i want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要含片吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lozenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.54,0:10:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啥  这东西不可疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? it's barely linty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.78,0:10:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那随便你了  我只是为你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, suit yourself. just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.88,0:10:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行了  快开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right. come on. let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.95,0:10:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你清楚其中的条件吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand the terms?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.13,0:11:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下注25年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buy-in's 25 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.64,0:11:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要赌50年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.71,0:11:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你这种爽快人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the cut of your jib.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.14,0:11:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,25\N{\fnArial\fs30}25.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.81,0:11:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,25年\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 25 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.27,0:11:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They go to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他现在要兑现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's cashing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.01,0:11:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  - 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean! - Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.02,0:12:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:01.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.82,0:12:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚可浪费了25年\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 25 years you just pissed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最好有把握能赢回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better be sure you can win them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发牌吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuffle up and deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.77,0:12:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这会很有意思的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.31,0:13:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.61,0:13:04.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.35,0:13:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你他娘是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.35,0:13:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.19,0:13:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.23,0:13:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.10,0:13:21.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我  你知道  找到那赌局了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, you know... found the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.06,0:13:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得你说你牌打得好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said you were g-good at poker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.47,0:13:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我打得确实好  闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  想冲老年人开枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you were just gonna shoot some old guy? Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.61,0:13:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你之前怎样  但是  你照过镜子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know what you were. I mean, h-have you seen you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来就像\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.34,0:13:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,, 《泰坦尼克号》里的老女人  我知道  闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old chick in "Titanic." I know. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.55,0:13:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想说的是皇帝帕尔帕庭[《星球大战》]\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna say "Emperor Palpatine".
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你见过约翰·麦凯恩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you met John McCain there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.56,0:13:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你们俩谁能告诉我到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Either of you want to tell me what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.93,0:13:50.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比犯傻了  就是这么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby's an idiot. That's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.93,0:13:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人让你去赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, nobody asked you to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.66,0:13:54.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我本该眼睁睁看你死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. I should have just let you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.56,0:13:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有  没人让你输\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for damn sure, nobody asked you to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.23,0:13:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,简直就像《斗气老顽童》\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like "Grumpy Old Men."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.53,0:13:58.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-闭嘴  萨姆  - 闭嘴  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up, Sam! - Shut up, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.40,0:14:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.14,0:14:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.41,0:14:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从有人传紧身衣起就开始玩扑克了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been playing poker since guys wore tights.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.44,0:14:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just don't get...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我懂  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I get it, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.51,0:14:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到了让时光逆转\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw a chance to turn the hands of the clock back
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.75,0:14:12.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离开那该死的轮椅的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get out of that damn chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.48,0:14:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常有诱惑力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty tempting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.42,0:14:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.09,0:14:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没失去过行动能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never been paralyzed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.92,0:14:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我跟你说  我下过地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I tell you something... I've been to hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.73,0:14:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那边还有个大天使等着拿我下油锅\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's an archangel there wanting me to drop the soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.43,0:14:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看看我  我比你倒霉多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me! My junk's rustier than yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.07,0:14:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听见我腹痛了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me bellyaching? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.47,0:14:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  听见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-actually, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我心脏病犯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm having a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.85,0:14:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胃酸倒流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acid reflux.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.52,0:14:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这年岁有些东西不好消化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys your age can't digest certain foods.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.95,0:14:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能吃奶酪汉堡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need to put down that cheeseburger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.30,0:15:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要继续发表感想\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you want to keep emoting
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.33,0:15:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是谈谈怎么解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you want to talk about solving
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.95,0:15:05.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在这个小问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}This little issue here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毛病肯定在筹码上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be about the chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.84,0:15:13.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把筹码推过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I slid 'em across,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.51,0:15:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帕特里克施了巫术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrick did his little witchy number,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.38,0:15:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你立刻就年轻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you prettied up in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.22,0:15:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说  你们怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what are you all thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.68,0:15:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是魔法筹码之类的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of magic chips or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.22,0:15:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.45,0:15:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-咒语还记得吗  - 记得  一清二楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You remember what he chanted? - Yep... every word.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.49,0:15:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好  我们就去查查他吧筹码藏在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then let's find out where he stashes his chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.89,0:15:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我偷50块出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And steal me 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.56,0:15:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本杰明·巴顿《本杰明·巴顿奇事》又有汉堡吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benjamin button me back into burger shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.63,0:15:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说你应该穿件衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you ought to put some clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.47,0:15:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以打扫房间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready for housekeeping, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.91,0:15:49.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,任何时候都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Born ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.18,0:15:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我祖父一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just like my grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.68,0:15:55.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他也是会动的东西都喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hits on anything that moves, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.35,0:15:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.89,0:15:58.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}And dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.17,0:16:10.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.29,0:16:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来人哪  他突然跑出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, get some help! He came out of nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.74,0:16:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.04,0:16:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有点儿喜欢这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kind of like the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.68,0:17:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就不上去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.00,0:17:46.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.81,0:19:02.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,廉价商店型号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dime-store model.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.45,0:19:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小事一桩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.29,0:19:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真杯具  当心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pathetic Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.93,0:19:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能打开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.17,0:19:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.27,0:19:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是酒吧里那个妞么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you the chick from the bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.08,0:19:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不止如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a lot more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.48,0:19:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事了  宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事了  他们没有恶意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. They're harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.22,0:19:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们想要筹码  拿去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys want chips? Take 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些只是筹码  爱因斯坦们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just chips, Einsteins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.96,0:19:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,演出道具\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's showmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.29,0:19:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们可能会很吃惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This may come as a shock,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.83,0:20:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但魔法并不存在于那些烂筹码上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the magic does not lie in a pile of crappy plywood
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.70,0:20:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不是那些无用的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or in any phony abracadabra.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.77,0:20:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,靠的是900岁的巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the 900-year-old witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.67,0:20:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们两想要恢复青春吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys want years?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.11,0:20:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就还是得按老规矩来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Score 'em the old-fashioned way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,德州扑克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Texas hold 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  放马过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.95,0:20:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我手上这种牌是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What card am i holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.42,0:20:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正如我所料\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what i thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.86,0:20:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,视力都已经退化了  那你的记忆力也不咋地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your eyesight's that bad, what about your memory?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不是侩子手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.70,0:20:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过呢  你就不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, on the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不行  萨姆  - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Sam. - Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.74,0:20:40.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  萨姆不太玩牌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, Sam not much of a player?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.37,0:20:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那就一路顺风  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, happy trails, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.64,0:20:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好享受你的暮色人生吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the twilight of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.61,0:20:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然你有机会搬回几成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should have taken better care of that ticker, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:20:57.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢走不送了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.26,0:21:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过话又说回来  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but, Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.83,0:21:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以你老哥的情况而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother's situation --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.66,0:21:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以就这么就算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's punishment enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.47,0:21:10.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不能让你这么简单地\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't let you leave
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点儿代价都不付出就拍拍屁股走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without a small parting gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.05,0:21:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.24,0:21:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很快就会知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find out soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.61,0:21:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们闪  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.36,0:21:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.56,0:21:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得那拍手绝对对你下咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe that he-witch gave you the clap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.34,0:21:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮忙推一把啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little help here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.55,0:22:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是觉得我该跟他赌一次的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I still think I should play.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.85,0:22:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.95,0:22:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本不够格\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.39,0:22:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我算得上个中好手  鲍比更是个中高手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm better. Bobby's way better.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.49,0:22:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果呢  我们都惨败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.66,0:22:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.39,0:22:16.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  我连发言权都没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? so I don't get a say in this anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.36,0:22:17.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  等你到了我们这个年纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, when you get to be our age --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.96,0:22:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你才三十啊  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're 30, Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.75,0:22:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是看你赌牌这么久看都看会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I've watched you hustle plenty of poker --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.01,0:22:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会还远远不够  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowing the game is not enough, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.78,0:22:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可不单单就是玩牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about playing the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.95,0:22:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是跟对方玩心理  我也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about playing the other guy. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.95,0:22:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连这都懂了  真了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hooray for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.39,0:22:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要说的是  我跟那家伙交过手\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I'm saying is, I played this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.89,0:22:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道他的手法  我对付得了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know his style. I can take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.59,0:22:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  鲍比  你的时日也不太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Bobby. you don't have enough years in the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.06,0:22:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.36,0:22:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  一旦输了你就没命了  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you'll die if you lose, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.00,0:22:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我还能怎样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what if i do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.93,0:22:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我活着是为了什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly am I living for, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.17,0:22:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等那该死的天启降世吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The damn apocalypse?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.07,0:22:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就因为我废在这轮椅上就该眼睁睁地看着大家死于非命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watching men die bloody while I sit in this chair,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.34,0:22:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而无能为力吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't take a step to help 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.71,0:22:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.91,0:22:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别  别阻止我  这是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. it's the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.78,0:22:56.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我年老\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm old...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.25,0:22:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又体残\N{\fnArial\fs30}And broke down...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.72,0:22:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我不能再\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.16,0:23:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经不再是猎魔人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't a hunter no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.53,0:23:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一无是处了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.40,0:23:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不是因为没勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I wasn't such a coward,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.80,0:23:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我早就该在从医院回来那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have stuck a gun in my mouth
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.43,0:23:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就吞枪自刎一了百了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Day I got home from the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.24,0:23:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  你不可以再去赌一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, you are not playing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.95,0:23:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不会  让你这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not... letting you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.05,0:23:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定另有它法可解  肯定有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's another way out of this. there's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.75,0:23:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.53,0:23:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.07,0:23:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以帮到你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.08,0:23:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.54,0:23:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们闻所未闻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most powerful reversal spell
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.82,0:24:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最强大的逆转法术\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've ever eye on
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.05,0:24:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是逆转什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it reverses what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.32,0:24:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帕特里克的巫术  所有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrick's work -- all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.25,0:24:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你  你的意思是我能恢复正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}You -- you saying I could be normal again?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.15,0:24:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不止你  所有和他交过手的人都能恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and everyone else he's ever played.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.89,0:24:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然是还活着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.43,0:24:16.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们凭啥相信你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell should we trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.16,0:24:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,信不信随便  无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, don't trust me. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.53,0:24:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总而言之这法术是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spell is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.93,0:24:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果对所有人都有效  那岂不是也包括你的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it zaps everyone, don't that include your man?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.54,0:24:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也包括对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.20,0:24:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look good for my age.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.07,0:24:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女士  这加上去的可不少啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady, this don't add up for squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.41,0:24:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.41,0:24:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我自有原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have my reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.65,0:24:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要做动作就要快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.85,0:24:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们明天就会离镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}We leave town tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.55,0:25:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.79,0:25:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你这一局能扳回一城  海希\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sense you've got me by the jewels on this one, Hesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.72,0:25:20.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fold.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.13,0:25:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你赢回多少年啊  貌似有13年吧  海希\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you up -- like 13 years there, Hesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.27,0:25:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看今天就到此为止吧  如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say we call it a day?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.37,0:25:34.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了  帕特里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Patrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.91,0:25:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海希来这儿是为了可以活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hesh here is gonna live
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.14,0:25:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲眼看到自己的孙女受洗礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see his granddaughter's bat mitzvah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.21,0:25:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对吗  海希\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that right, Hesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.81,0:25:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再次谢谢你  帕特里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks again, Patrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.95,0:25:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[希伯来语] 再见了  我的朋友  再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shalom, my friend. Shalom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.82,0:25:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还挺有良心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was nice of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.99,0:25:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来就是个有良心的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.53,0:25:57.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么可以为你效劳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do you for?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.00,0:26:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.55,0:26:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀人犯的下颚骨  搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jawbone of a murderer. great.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.02,0:26:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  这主意真是糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this really sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.42,0:26:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么确定她的法术会奏效呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we even know her spell's gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.39,0:26:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没法确定  但我们有第二条路选吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't. but we ain't got a plan "b."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.16,0:26:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以别再唧唧歪歪了  继续挖吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, less flappin' and more diggin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.26,0:26:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  偶滴神啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.03,0:26:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的手肘  感觉全身都嘎吱嘎吱响了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My elbows! i'm all creaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.17,0:26:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,速度些  别跟个小孩一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up, you crybaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.30,0:26:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去你的  你倒是试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pound it up your ass, ironsides.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.94,0:26:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就一个小墓穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}One little grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.34,0:26:44.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.71,0:26:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我马上飞过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. i'll hop right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.75,0:26:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少你的腿没有知觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least your legs are numb.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.31,0:26:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老爷爷  闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up and dig, grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.58,0:26:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的背\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.42,0:26:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能站直吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you straighten up?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.09,0:26:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能  但你表示下同情会死呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but a little sympathy wouldn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.19,0:26:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,屁股蛋有刺痛感吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Butt cheek tingling?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.49,0:27:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这挺隐私的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's kind of personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.59,0:27:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是有咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So "yeah"?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.76,0:27:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是坐骨神经痛  放心死不了  继续挖\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's sciatica. you'll live. keep digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.33,0:27:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, bobby...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.53,0:27:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干掉你  正式进入我的遗愿清单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing you is officially on my bucket list.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.97,0:27:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你  萨姆  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like you, sam. i do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.61,0:27:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你很聪明  而且心地好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're smart, and your heart's clearly in the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.35,0:27:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,单单是一眼  我就能看出一个人很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can tell a lot about a guy by looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.69,0:27:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是一个巫师么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean you're psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.92,0:27:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  那样是作弊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. that'd be cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.09,0:27:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是指传统的直觉哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about good old-fashioned intuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.73,0:27:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续玩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. let's just play.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.53,0:27:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是在玩呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.57,0:27:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你哥哥知道你在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does your big brother know you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.74,0:27:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,5注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet five.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.61,0:27:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看样子不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.38,0:27:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加筹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I raise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.81,0:27:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you are, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.45,0:28:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,试图去给他们擦屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to clean up their mess,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.75,0:28:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是他们还是想把你当小孩对待\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they still want to sit you at the kiddie table.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.49,0:28:09.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不再是小弟弟了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the little brother anymore, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.93,0:28:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then again...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.30,0:28:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也许是\N{\fnArial\fs30}...maybe you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.23,0:28:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有点理解不了了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in over your head here, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.47,0:28:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你当然可以继续这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you can keep making these moves --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.14,0:28:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好比说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.31,0:28:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心翼翼的下注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playing it cautious,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.78,0:28:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,计算几率\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playing the percentages.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.15,0:28:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我还是会把你送进敬老院的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But i'm still gonna kick your arse into the nursing home.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.85,0:28:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是不是这种空谈心理学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this armchair-psychology routine
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.05,0:28:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对你来说常常有效吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually work for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.92,0:28:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.35,0:28:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是那个正在输的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who's losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.25,0:29:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,休息一下好么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little break?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.82,0:29:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那边怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.99,0:29:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think it's going?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.33,0:29:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那边呢  找到你要找的东西没\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you? you have everything you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.29,0:29:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是要找到那男巫的DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still need a little he-witch dna.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.33,0:29:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他之前叼着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was chewing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.70,0:29:21.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up, dean. please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.23,0:29:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  别让他空下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. just keep him busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.30,0:29:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, sammy...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.87,0:29:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.02,0:30:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,扔进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.64,0:30:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.57,0:30:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看起来怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do i look?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.24,0:30:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,提问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.74,0:30:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是想把这个给你哥哥吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what you meant to give your big brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.64,0:30:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你给他的那根我从来没碰过嘴唇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one you gave him never passed my lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.88,0:30:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,屁用都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't do a scrap of good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.95,0:30:49.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不喜欢作弊  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like cheating, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.75,0:31:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停下来  帕特里克  放了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it! patrick, let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.91,0:31:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他想要杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.85,0:31:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我做的  我给他的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it! i gave him the spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.78,0:31:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.74,0:31:19.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.83,0:31:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.86,0:31:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.37,0:31:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.72,0:31:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep...playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.53,0:31:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每样东西我们都没弄错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything we put in that spell was kosher.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.66,0:31:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  就是除了那个该死的牙签\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, everything except the damn toothpick.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.40,0:32:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须拿到些DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to go get a speck of dna.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.20,0:32:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得抓紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strap on your track shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.90,0:32:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, goody.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.07,0:32:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又得走楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}More stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.61,0:32:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里真他娘的干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too damn clean in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.68,0:32:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我算是第一次碰见\N{\fnArial\fs30}First witch i ever heard of
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.15,0:32:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不乱吐唾沫的巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't spew bodily fluids all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.35,0:32:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,牙刷  梳子  随便什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toothbrush, comb -- anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.19,0:32:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at you --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.93,0:32:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,计算型玩家要全压了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The percentage player betting the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.83,0:32:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可不行哦  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awful transparent of you, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.76,0:32:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我手气像你那么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if i had a monster hand like you have,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.60,0:32:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就会算计你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd trap you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.34,0:32:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你过于兴奋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you get so excited,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.74,0:32:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把鸡蛋都放到一个篮子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet yourself right out of a big pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.31,0:32:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,合牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fold.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.11,0:32:47.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜是一对Q\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set of ladies, i'm guessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.46,0:33:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,偷鸡偷的不错么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.12,0:33:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我们有时间  我真会跟你好好玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we had time, i could make a real player out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.23,0:33:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.97,0:33:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.57,0:33:13.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是迪恩可以不一定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But i can't say the same for dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.14,0:33:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你哥哥马上就要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother's gonna be dead soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.41,0:33:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说的马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when i say "soon"...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.28,0:33:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是指分钟哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.92,0:33:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说结束之前  游戏不会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game's not over till i say it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.73,0:33:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盲注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.68,0:33:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事关你兄弟的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, when it's about your brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.11,0:33:51.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就变得情绪激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get so emotional,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.78,0:33:53.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的心思完全就飞了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brain just flies right out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.82,0:33:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.15,0:33:56.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.55,0:34:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我全押\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.97,0:34:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.93,0:34:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有结束了我才能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't leave until it's over?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.46,0:34:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就让它结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.26,0:34:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说  我哥哥在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where's my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.77,0:34:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你这样玩牌  无异于自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there's poker and then there's suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.68,0:34:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just play the hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.70,0:34:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean? dean, you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.78,0:34:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.28,0:34:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.57,0:34:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉  小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.84,0:34:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三条A\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aces full.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.35,0:35:04.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.29,0:35:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,作为一个女巫你很善良  但这样却有点毛骨悚然\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a witch, you're so nice, it's actually kind of creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.76,0:35:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.83,0:35:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确实是好牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a great hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.07,0:35:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.77,0:35:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}...not as great...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.51,0:35:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比不上4条4\N{\fnArial\fs30}...as four 4s.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.09,0:35:46.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玩得不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well played.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.30,0:35:49.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要知道  刚才那一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, that whole...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.70,0:35:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,使你失去理智的言论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going-out-of-your-head bit --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.80,0:35:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的非常奏效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very method.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.80,0:35:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你真的很不简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's more to you than meets the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.14,0:36:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些筹码全部给迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cash these in for dean, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.91,0:36:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乐意效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.66,0:36:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.08,0:36:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.40,0:36:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是呆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idjit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.00,0:36:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.14,0:36:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.71,0:36:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别逼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.64,0:36:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.65,0:36:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我埋葬了自己的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I buried my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.15,0:36:46.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她变成了这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she looked like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.06,0:36:49.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一切是不正常的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.60,0:37:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.40,0:37:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自从你选择和我在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you decided to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.14,0:37:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也就选择了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.81,0:37:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你依然年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still young.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.18,0:37:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如此美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.28,0:37:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.41,0:37:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想念我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.68,0:37:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉  帕特里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, patrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.29,0:37:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you loved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.35,0:37:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.62,0:37:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  我当然爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart, of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.26,0:37:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我能断绝过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was cut out for this,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.00,0:37:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.13,0:37:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能没有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think i can do this without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.30,0:37:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在你遇见我之前  很久以来  你也过得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got on okay for a long time before you met me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.21,0:37:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下注吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.58,0:37:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全押\N{\fnArial\fs30}All-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.69,0:38:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全押\N{\fnArial\fs30}All-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.29,0:38:25.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.57,0:38:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有出千  你凭实力打败了那家伙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No tricks -- you actually beat the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.24,0:38:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.84,0:38:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走运而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.44,0:38:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回头见  伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I'll see y'all guys later.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.01,0:38:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.21,0:38:53.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.95,0:38:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去打疫苗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A booster shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.49,0:39:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.06,0:39:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们该把东西装上车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess we can get the van loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.13,0:39:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不该说你是笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have called you an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.60,0:39:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说哪次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which time?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.77,0:39:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.81,0:39:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I actually -- I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.01,0:39:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我理解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.15,0:39:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,衰老可不是单身派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting old ain't a bachelor party.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.15,0:39:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再加上你所在的处境\N{\fnArial\fs30}And dealing with the crap you got to deal with...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.15,0:39:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少来说什么同情的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you go on pity patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.31,0:39:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.12,0:39:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not. I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.22,0:39:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  如果我是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying, you know, if I was in your shoes...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.06,0:39:37.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会喋喋不休抱怨到死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd never stop complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.16,0:39:41.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.73,0:39:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是毫无用处的  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not useless, bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.34,0:39:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.54,0:39:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.00,0:39:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait a minute. listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.80,0:40:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即使士兵在战斗中负伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't stop being a soldier
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.44,0:40:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不会因此而退出\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you got wounded in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.22,0:40:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗  不管你变成什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? No matter what shape you're in,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.67,0:40:09.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最起码  你是我们的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bottom line is, you're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.83,0:40:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可能没注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if you've noticed,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.78,0:40:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我和萨姆  已经没有多少可牵绊的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But me and sam, we don't have much left.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.30,0:40:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能没有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.50,0:40:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.74,0:40:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,决不允许你再说要退出\N{\fnArial\fs30}So don't you dare think about checking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.74,0:40:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再听到第二遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hear that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.72,0:40:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.21,0:40:37.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.93,0:40:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.14,0:40:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.73,0:40:52.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们肉麻完了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we done feeling our feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.07,0:40:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我们开始越来越像娘们之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'd like to get out of this room
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.94,0:40:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想离开这房间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we both start growing lady parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.87,0:40:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.18,0:41:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  轮椅神探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, ironsides.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.12,0:41:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非这样叫我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that one's sticking, huh?

